==Strategy==
This stage can be a little difficult for beginner players. Main strategy is sending out tanky units like [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] or fast ones like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]]. Be fast about it otherwise the Assassin Bears will destroy your base in no time. Notably, the [[True Form]] of Titan Cat, Jamiera, makes the stage much easier due to its increased stats.

